  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Cross-Sector Capacity for Disease Surveillance, Epidemic Preparedness, and Response from Designated Points of Entry along the Mobility Corridors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to the improvement of health security from entry points and sentinel sites along mobility corridors to facilitate the achievement of the expected results of the project on strengthening regional disease surveillance systems in Central Africa (REDISSE IV), including by ensuring better collaboration in disease surveillance,  epidemic preparedness; and immediate and effective response in the event of a health crisis or emergency at borders and along mobility corridors in the DRC.</narrative>
  </description>
